s or concerns you may have.\n\nWe are experiencing a high level of excitement and anticipation for this project and we are confident that with your participation and input we can make it a huge success. We are looking forward to seeing you on Friday and working together to make this project a reality.\n\nIf you have any dietary restrictions or special requests please let us know in advance so we can make the necessary arrangements. We will be providing refreshments and snacks during the meeting.\n\nWe are confident that this meeting will be a productive and informative one and we look forward to your participation. If you have any questions or concerns please do not hesitate to reach out to us.\n\nThank you for your time and we look forward to seeing you on Friday.\n\nBest regards\n[Your Name]\n\nProject Manager\n\nAttachments: Project Plan and Timeline", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.005859940778464079}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -1.6450998783111572}, {"token": " Invitation", "logprob": -0.008594444021582603}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.6689314179529902e-06}, {"token": " Meeting", "logprob": -0.5632714033126831}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.3463132679462433}, {"token": " Up", "logprob": -1.9754680395126343}, {"token": "coming", "logprob": -1.1920930376163597e-07}, {"token": " Project", "logprob": -0.0017991744680330157}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.6477832198143005}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": -1.0728841743912199e-06}, {"token": " Participants", "logprob": -0.6132216453552246}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.004900941625237465}, {"token": "We", "logprob": -0.29479822516441345}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.03464220464229584}, {"token": " writing", "logprob": -0.1679336428642273}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.1920930376163597e-07}, {"token": " formally", "logprob": -0.47088053822517395}, {"token": " invite", "logprob": -9.27491273614578e-05}, {"token": " you", "logprob": -0.00044230464845895767}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.00